# Piik 3.0 Rust Server configuration
# The environment-variable template is deploy/container/.env.example.
# From the repository root, copy it to deploy/container/.env and edit its values:
# docker compose --env-file deploy/container/.env -f deploy/container/compose.yaml up -d
#
# Standalone Server startup: prototype/channel-server/README.md#run
# The Rust Server reads its process environment; it does not load .env itself.
# For systemd, deploy/systemd/piik.service.example reads /etc/piik/piik.env.
#
# Published 2.x configuration: https://github.com/TNTcraftHIM/Piik/blob/main/docs/standards/configuration.md
